# dispatcher.list — Asterisk node set for Kamailio dispatcher module.
# Format: set_id destination flags priority attrs
# Two Asterisk nodes; weights balance roughly evenly. In single-host dev only
# node 1 (asterisk) is reachable; node 2 (asterisk2) is provisioned for the
# HA deployment described in deploy/README.md.

1 sip:asterisk:5060 weight=5 ;asterisk-node-1
2 sip:asterisk2:5060 weight=5 ;asterisk-node-2
